REQ: 实现角色三种状态（静止/行走/跑步）切换，按键控制并显示当前状态
API: Phaser.Scene, Phaser.Input.Keyboard, Phaser.GameObjects.Graphics, Phaser.GameObjects.Text, Phaser.GameObjects.Rectangle
