REQ: 实现鼠标点击发射子弹射击敌人，命中后敌人消失并统计击杀数
API: this.input.on, this.physics.add.sprite, this.physics.add.overlap, this.add.text, Graphics.generateTexture
STEPS:
1. 创建玩家、敌人和子弹的 Graphics 纹理
