REQ: 实现收集物品玩法，场景中生成10个紫色可收集物体，玩家碰到后消失并加分，显示分数
API: Phaser.Physics.Arcade.Group, Phaser.Physics.Arcade.ArcadePhysics#overlap, Phaser.GameObjects.Text, Phaser.GameObjects.Graphics
STEPS:
