REQ: 3个橙色物体以160速度随机移动，碰撞边界和彼此时反弹
API: Phaser.Physics.Arcade.Group, Phaser.GameObjects.Graphics, Phaser.Physics.Arcade.Collider, setBounce, setVelocity, setCollideWorldBounds
STEPS:
