REQ: 实现可拖拽的蓝色菱形，拖拽时变色，松手后回到初始位置
API: Graphics.fillStyle, Graphics.fillPath, InputPlugin.setDraggable, Events.DRAG_START, Events.DRAG, Events.DRAG_END
STEPS:
