[PLAN]
REQ: 实现黄色敌人以120速度追踪玩家，玩家以144速度可躲避
API: Phaser.Physics.Arcade.Sprite, Phaser.Physics.Arcade.ArcadePhysics#moveToObject, Phaser.Input.Keyboard.createCursorKeys
STEPS:
