REQ: 实现双跳功能，角色可连续跳跃两次后才需落地，跳跃力度200，重力800
API: Phaser.Physics.Arcade, Phaser.Input.Keyboard, Phaser.GameObjects.Graphics, Phaser.GameObjects.Text
STEPS:
