REQ: 无尽模式波次系统，敌人数量和速度递增，显示波次和击杀数
API: Phaser.Physics.Arcade.Group, Phaser.GameObjects.Graphics, Phaser.GameObjects.Text, Phaser.Time.TimerEvent, Phaser.Physics.Arcade.Sprite
STEPS:
