REQ: 实现追踪镜头与震屏效果，玩家与敌人碰撞时触发1.5秒camera shake并扣减生命值显示
API: Phaser.Cameras.Scene2D.Camera#startFollow, Phaser.Cameras.Scene2D.Camera#shake, Phaser.Physics.Arcade.Physics#addCollider, Phaser.GameObjects.Text
STEPS:
