REQ: 实现黄色Boss战，8点血量，被子弹命中扣血，血量归零显示胜利
API: Phaser.Physics.Arcade, Phaser.GameObjects.Graphics, Phaser.Input.Pointer, Phaser.Physics.Arcade.Sprite, Phaser.GameObjects.Text
STEPS:
