REQ: 实现15个白色物体的拖拽排序，松手后按Y坐标自动排列
API: Phaser.GameObjects.Graphics, Phaser.Input.InputPlugin.setDraggable, Phaser.Input.Events.DRAG, Phaser.Input.Events.DRAG_END, Phaser.Tweens.TweenManager
STEPS:
